flowchart TD
    Client[Authenticated service client] -->|HTTPS via trusted reverse proxy| HTTP[Django ASGI HTTP adapter]
    HTTP --> Auth[Bearer token authentication]
    Auth --> Limit[Per-client fixed-window rate limit]
    Limit --> Cache[(Redis in production)]
    Limit --> Schema[Pydantic input validation]
    Schema --> UseCase[IngestTrade application service]
    UseCase --> Domain[Pure Decimal risk and notional calculations]
    UseCase --> Bridge[sync_to_async thread-sensitive boundary]
    Bridge --> ORM[Django ORM transaction and idempotency]
    ORM --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    HTTP --> Response[JSON response with Decimal strings]
    Release[Separate release command] --> Migrate[Django migrations]
    Migrate --> DB
